# 10 ps NVT molecular dynamics on the GFN2-xTB surface, implicit water
! XTB2 MD ALPB(water)
%pal nprocs 8 end
%md
  Timestep 0.5_fs
  Initvel 300_K
  Thermostat NHC 300_K Timecon 50.0_fs
  Dump Position Stride 20 Filename "o03-xtb-md.traj.xyz"
  Run 20000
end
* xyzfile 0 1 ../o01-xtb-opt-freq/o01-xtb-opt-freq.xyz
